{"id":"G1497","lema":"εἴδωλον","lemaStrong":"εἴδωλον","translit":"eídōlon","pron":"","glosa":"","defStrong":"an image (i.e. for worship); by implication, a heathen god, or (plural) the worship of such","defKjv":"idol","derivacion":"from G1491 (εἶδος);","veces":11,"versos":11,"refs":["Hch 7:41","Hch 15:20","Ro 2:22","1 Co 8:4","1 Co 8:7","1 Co 10:19","1 Co 12:2","2 Co 6:16","1 Ts 1:9","1 Jn 5:21","Ap 9:20"],"texto":"Textus Receptus (Scrivener 1894)"}